/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> The River's Tread (Black Jade God-Kicking Boots \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1naCw5T8uWkTpQkoLxeg37AtQUnE-jvrJox5GznQzcYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Shadow Blood Claws (Black Jade Razor Claws \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1a-0XmkVnsvjNFPyPWm-n5L_a1rV5YMSJNuMWx4Ej8IU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Wood's Grasp (Green Jade Short Powerbow \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PQpMtRbr-dXu5kjHRI0FtG81mjPteBezIr-NWtA706E/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Virtuous Warden (White Jade Articulated Plate \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fc9jVtl9SEO-r_AhK2yf_38SZZsK3TGp_2dNgMboa5g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Stellar Hawk (Starmetal Grand Daiklave \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-P5E9lt4BqNewOeHWmpOqtNgwsS-BBynbPk9E1tHJAU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Saturn's Emmisary (Starmetal Grand Grimscythe \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hZYmtEUYTpdo-br9jWORyFs5l7X7-pnzO9Es6nxoV5g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Electrum Colossus' Mantle (Moonsilver Symbiotic Brawling Thingy \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13DKffBqhl8jmDAiEah-8Kv-cEOfv4NJqqEbssIk8axc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> <br /> And more to come.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-11T17:51:03-07:00","id":1311463,"title":"","content":"Where the fuck did this clone post come from?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-11T18:04:44-07:00","id":1311467,"title":"","content":"That's a nice collection, thanks for sharing! That Grand Grimscythe will be perfect for one of the antagonists in a game I'm running.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.t