y theory.<br /> <br /> Both versions of your thread got caught by the forum's spam filter that treats posting a lot of links at once as potential bot activity but it doesn't delete the posts in question and instead holds them until a mod approves or deletes them and two of them ended up being approved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-21T07:54:50-07:00","id":1313497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311228-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew?p=1313485#post1313485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having seen this <a href=\"http://http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/trouble-tickets/1311134-can-t-post\" target=\"_blank\">thread</a> by you I'll offer you my theory.<br /> <br /> Both versions of your thread got caught by the forum's spam filter that treats posting a lot of links at once as potential bot activity but it doesn't delete the posts in question and instead holds them until a mod approves or deletes them and two of them ended up being approved.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, that